 "answer_text": "Found 4 disease records for brca1: Familial cancer of breast [1], Familial breast-ovarian cancer susceptibility 1 [2], Pancreatic cancer susceptibility 4 [3] and Fanconi anemia complementation group S [4]. \n\nBRCA1 is linked to familial cancer of breast [1], familial breast-ovarian cancer susceptibility 1 [2], pancreatic cancer susceptibility 4 [3], and Fanconi anemia complementation group S [4]. \n\nMutations in BRCA1 are responsible for approximately 40% of inherited breast cancers and more than 80% of inherited breast and ovarian cancers [5]. \n\nDisease records found\n\nDisease name: Familial cancer of breast [1]. Disease name: Familial breast-ovarian cancer susceptibility 1 [2]. Disease name: Pancreatic cancer susceptibility 4 [3]. Disease name: Fanconi anemia complementation group S [4]. \n\nGene records found\n\nGene symbol: BRCA1 [6]. Gene name: BRCA1 [10]. \n\nPubmed records found\n\nPubmed title: PTEN alterations in sporadic and BRCA1-associated triple negative breast carcinomas [7]. Pubmed title: BRCA1: An Endocrine and Metabolic Regulator [12]. Pubmed title: Preneoplastic stromal cells promote BRCA1-mediated breast tumorigenesis [15]. Pubmed title: Mechanism of BRCA1-BARD1 function in DNA end resection and DNA protection [18]. Pubmed title: Targeting GPX4-mediated ferroptosis protection sensitizes BRCA1-deficient cancer cells to PARP inhibitors [21]. \n\nClinvar records found\n\nClinvar title: NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.5243_5277+2788del [8]. Clinvar title: NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.5277+2916_5277+2946delinsGG [13]. Clinvar title: NG_005905.2:g.(147057_150288)_(160933_166866)del [16]. Clinvar title: GRCh37/hg19 17q21.31(chr17:41267743-41267796)x3 [19]. Clinvar title: NM_007294.4(BRCA1):c.2145C>G (p.Thr715=) [22]. \n\nOmim records found\n\nBRCA1 DNA REPAIR-ASSOCIATED PROTEIN [9]. BRCA1 [9]. \n\nClinical trial records found\n\nClinical trial name: Germline BRCA1 and BRCA2 Mutations in Jewish Women Affected by Breast Cancer [11]. Clinical trial name: